type: software
title: "Open Bibliometric Study of the ETH Domain (2014–2023): data warehouse pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Code used to build the data warehouse behind the bibliometric reports of the
  six ETH Domain institutions (ETH Zurich, EPFL, PSI, WSL, Empa, Eawag). It
  downloads an OpenAlex snapshot (3 September 2025), keeps in-scope works,
  matches them against the publication lists provided by the institutional
  libraries, adds metrics missing from OpenAlex (e.g. author gender, patent
  citations) and builds a DuckDB database with field-normalised citation
  indicators.
